  "description": "Digital signatures for DocWright: verify the signatures of an OPC package (.docx, .xlsx and other Office files) with per-part results, so you learn which part broke a signature, sign a package with SHA-256/384/512, and sign a PDF as an incremental update. Signing goes through a provider you implement, so DocWright never holds a private key and never decides trust; HSM, KMS and smart-card signing all fit.",
